Author identity statement
-------------------------

All code in this project is authored by human contributors. AI tools are used
only as assistants and are not authors. Historical `Co-Authored-By: Claude`
lines in commits record that a tool was used; they are not an authorship claim
and grant no rights. Future commits, pull requests, issues, and release notes
must not include AI attribution or "Generated with" statements.

